content:
Members of long standing keep more of their Cash when an item arrives damaged or never arrives. Under the refund-without-return reversal schedule of Northgate Rewards and Northgate+ Memberships, the tenure of the membership on the refund date adds to the relief fraction of the reversal, measured in whole calendar months from the membership's term start date to the refund date (a month counting when the refund date reaches the same day of the month as the term start date):

- a refund dated **24** or more whole calendar months after the term start date adds **0.1**;
- one dated **12** to fewer than **24** whole calendar months after it adds **0.05**;
- any other refund, including one on a membership record with no term start date, adds nothing.

**Boundary pair (hypothetical term start date 30 June 2030).** A refund dated 29 June 2031 is 11 whole months on and adds nothing; one dated 30 June 2031 is 12 whole months on and adds 0.05.
